          </p>

          <p>
            Meal shakes from other brands follow the same pattern. Our <a href="/kachava-review/">Ka'Chava review</a> compares another popular meal shake on the same terms, and our <a href="/how-much-protein-do-i-need/">how much protein do I need</a> guide helps you work out whether you need extra protein at all, or simply more regular meals.
