          <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-white mb-4">The Bottom Line</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            Huel is two brands in one bag. Complete Protein is a reasonable vegan protein powder with added vitamins, a small 20 g scoop and sucralose in the US formula. Black Edition is one of the better powdered meals you can buy, with 40 g of protein, plenty of fiber and no artificial sweeteners, but it carries about 400 calories and should replace a meal rather than sit on top of one.
          </p>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
